---
const items = [
  { label: "Framework", value: "Astro 5", accent: "teal" },
  { label: "Runtime",   value: "Node 22", accent: "orange" },
  { label: "Container", value: "Docker multi-stage", accent: "teal" },
  { label: "CI/CD",     value: "GitHub Actions + GitLab CI", accent: "orange" },
];
---

<section class="stack">
  <h2>Lo que pasa cuando empujas un commit</h2>
  <p class="stack-lead">
    Un solo <code>git push</code> dispara dos pipelines en paralelo.
    Mismo intent, sintaxis distinta.
  </p>

  <ul class="stack-grid">
    {items.map(({ label, value, accent }) => (
      <li class:list={["stack-card", `accent-${accent}`]}>
        <span class="stack-label">{label}</span>
        <span class="stack-value">{value}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .stack {
    padding-block: 2rem;
  }
  .stack-lead {
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .stack-grid {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .stack-card {
    background: var(--c-surface);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--c-divider);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .accent-teal   { border-left-color: var(--c-t1); }
  .accent-orange { border-left-color: var(--c-t2); }
  .stack-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--c-muted);
  }
  .accent-teal   .stack-label { color: var(--c-t1); }
  .accent-orange .stack-label { color: var(--c-t2); }
  .stack-value {
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--c-text);
  }
</style>
